		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Plasmic mix of black tar and alchemist's fire. Hunts dark places and forgotten labs. Smells like sulfur.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 7, <strong>HP</strong> 21, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 tentacle +4 (2d6 + oil), <strong>MV</strong> close (climb), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> -3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -4, <strong>W</strong> -3, <strong>Ch</strong> -4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Immune to fire and lightning.</p><p></p><p><strong>Inferno</strong>. If hit with fire or lightning, immolates in a near-sized cube of fire centered on ooze, DEX 15+ or 2d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Oil</strong>. Cover target in flammable, sticky oil.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
